for him and everyone else to see.

00:11:02.595 --> 00:11:05.264
The president, Lynskey and I are united

00:11:05.965 --> 00:11:07.366
to countries together

00:11:07.366 --> 00:11:09.468
to make sure he can not succeed.

00:11:10.069 --> 00:11:11.937
And I think I may be mistaken,

00:11:11.937 --> 00:11:15.374
but I know I judge every leader

00:11:15.374 --> 00:11:16.175
by the way,

00:11:16.175 --> 00:11:17.076
they what they say

00:11:17.076 --> 00:11:18.778
to me, their consistency

00:11:18.778 --> 00:11:21.480
and looking beyond this guy has in his

00:11:21.480 --> 00:11:25.084
to his very soul is who he says he is.

00:11:25.351 --> 00:11:27.153
It's clear who he is.

00:11:27.153 --> 00:11:27.687
He's willing to

00:11:27.687 --> 00:11:29.455
give his life for his country

00:11:29.455 --> 00:11:30.956
and all the folks who

00:11:30.956 --> 00:11:32.425
came with him today.

00:11:32.425 --> 00:11:33.959
And so I think it's

00:11:33.959 --> 00:11:34.927
he important

00:11:34.927 --> 00:11:36.162
and important

00:11:36.162 --> 00:11:36.862
for him to know

00:11:36.862 --> 00:11:37.396
we are going

00:11:37.396 --> 00:11:39.699
to do everything in our power,

00:11:39.699 --> 00:11:40.700
everything in our power

00:11:40.700 --> 00:11:43.202
to see that he succeeds.

00:11:43.636 --> 00:11:44.403
What was the second part

00:11:44.403 --> 00:11:45.104
of your question?

00:11:45.104 --> 00:11:47.106
I just asked if you would discuss

00:11:47.106 --> 00:11:47.707
how the U.S.

00:11:47.707 --> 00:11:49.608
calculated the escalatory effect

00:11:49.608 --> 00:11:50.476
of sending a Patriot

00:11:50.476 --> 00:11:51.977
missile battery to Ukraine?

00:11:51.977 --> 00:11:53.779
I did not discuss that at all

00:11:53.779 --> 00:11:57.116
with with the president, but I we do not.

00:11:57.116 --> 00:11:59.118
It's a defensive system.

00:11:59.118 --> 00:12:01.587
It's a defensive weapon system.

00:12:01.587 --> 00:12:03.889
It's not escalatory is defensive

00:12:04.290 --> 00:12:06.559
and it's easy to not.

00:12:06.592 --> 00:12:08.694
And we'd love to not have to have them

00:12:08.694 --> 00:12:10.362
use it to stop the attacks.

00:12:12.331 --> 00:12:14.934
President Zelensky, again, welcome.

00:12:15.501 --> 00:12:15.668
Well,

00:12:15.668 --> 00:12:16.869
you mentioned earlier

00:12:16.869 --> 00:12:18.904
that you wanted to make this trip

00:12:20.072 --> 00:12:21.507
for a while now.

00:12:21.507 --> 00:12:22.441
Why now?

00:12:22.441 --> 00:12:23.042
And also,

00:12:23.042 --> 00:12:24.810
can you tell me what you think

00:12:24.810 --> 00:12:26.412
the message you are sending to President

00:12:26.412 --> 00:12:28.714
Putin is given the fact that 24 hours ago

00:12:28.714 --> 00:12:30.616
you were on the ground in the front lines

00:12:30.616 --> 00:12:32.585
with artillery echoing behind you,

00:12:32.585 --> 00:12:33.786
and now you find yourself

00:12:33.786 --> 00:12:34.587
in the White House

00:12:34.587 --> 00:12:36.856
standing next to the president

00:12:39.258 --> 00:12:41.460
on this joke.

00:12:41.460 --> 00:12:44.196
Thank you very much for your question.

00:12:44.196 --> 00:12:44.730
Sure.

00:12:45.097 --> 00:12:46.899
As to

00:12:47.700 --> 00:12:49.135
your key message,

00:12:49.135 --> 00:12:51.270
what is the message for Putin?

00:12:51.437 --> 00:12:52.238
Yesterday,

00:12:52.238 --> 00:12:55.574
I am standing here in the United States

00:12:55.574 --> 00:12:58.144
with President Biden on the same podium

00:12:58.844 --> 00:13:01.147
because I respect him

00:13:01.147 --> 00:13:03.549
as a person,

00:13:04.049 --> 00:13:08.187
as a president, as a human being for his

00:13:09.255 --> 00:13:10.156
position.

00:13:10.156 --> 00:13:13.192
And for me, this is a historic moment.

00:13:13.793 --> 00:13:15.027
I can send messages

00:13:15.027 --> 00:13:17.062
to President Biden, for example,

00:13:17.429 --> 00:13:19.465
If it's not serious, you said

00:13:19.899 --> 00:13:21.167
what's going to happen

00:13:21.167 --> 00:13:23.502
after patriots are installed?

00:13:24.270 --> 00:13:27.306
After that, we will send another signal

00:13:27.306 --> 00:13:29.108
to President Biden

00:13:29.108 --> 00:13:31.844
that we would like to get more patriots

00:13:34.113 --> 00:13:36.081
and we're worried that is our ally.

00:13:36.081 --> 00:13:38.350
We are in the war. I'm sorry.

00:13:38.350 --> 00:13:40.619
I'm really sorry.

00:13:40.619 --> 00:13:43.189
That is my appreciation.

00:13:44.924 --> 00:13:46.926
To President Putin

00:13:48.727 --> 00:13:51.096
in 2019

00:13:51.096 --> 00:13:54.834
we had Normandy meeting in 2019

00:13:54.834 --> 00:13:56.468
I became the president of Ukraine.

00:13:56.468 --> 00:13:58.470
And at that time we were sending

00:13:58.470 --> 00:14:01.340
maximum messages to President Putin

00:14:01.874 --> 00:14:02.741
telling him

00:14:02.741 --> 00:14:04.376
that there should not be

00:14:04.376 --> 00:14:05.845
a full scale invasion

00:14:05.845 --> 00:14:07.179
to stop aggression,

00:14:07.179 --> 00:14:09.381
to renew our territory and

00:14:10.015 --> 00:14:11.517
territorial integrity,

00:14:11.517 --> 00:14:14.186
to find diplomatic solution.

00:14:14.587 --> 00:14:16.021
Well, God forbid

00:14:16.021 --> 00:14:18.090
we should not have a full scale war.

00:14:18.090 --> 00:14:20.659
At that time, we said it won't happen.

00:14:20.926 --> 00:14:21.961
He was lying.

00:14:21.961 --> 00:14:23.462
So what kind of message

00:14:23.462 --> 00:14:26.198
I can send him after he actually.

00:14:27.032 --> 00:14:27.700
If

00:14:28.601 --> 00:14:30.402
Ukraine is destroyed,

00:14:30.402 --> 00:14:32.671
our life is destroying our life.

00:14:32.671 --> 00:14:34.440
He can even go further

00:14:34.440 --> 00:14:35.608
somewhere where

00:14:35.608 --> 00:14:37.810
the Soviet Union stayed before this.

00:14:37.810 --> 00:14:40.045
So he might want to invade

00:14:40.045 --> 00:14:41.881
those territories, too.

00:14:41.881 --> 00:14:44.149
I believe that there is something

00:14:45.150 --> 00:14:45.784
more to

00:14:45.784 --> 00:14:45.951
learn

00:14:45.951 --> 00:14:46.852
about his

00:14:46.852 --> 00:14:49.088
inadequate approach to the world.

00:14:49.221 --> 00:14:51.757
Why we need to send him a message.

00:14:51.957 --> 00:14:54.560
He needs to be interested in

00:14:54.894 --> 00:14:57.396
getting attention from the world

00:14:57.696 --> 00:14:59.131
because he is not the subject

00:14:59.131 --> 00:15:00.833
of civilized people.

00:15:00.833 --> 00:15:04.837
He should be interested in trying to save

00:15:04.837 --> 00:15:07.506
something of his culture

00:15:07.506 --> 00:15:09.408
and history of his country.

00:15:09.408 --> 00:15:10.776
So that's his problem.

00:15:10.776 --> 00:15:11.377
Now,

00:15:14.613 --> 00:15:15.681
in presenting this,

00:15:15.681 --> 00:15:18.183
this will be the last question

00:15:19.084 --> 00:15:20.753
Only one plus one TV

00:15:20.753 --> 00:15:21.754
channel

00:15:22.187 --> 00:15:24.523
wins a full scale invasion are started.

00:15:24.523 --> 00:15:24.890
U.S.

00:15:24.890 --> 00:15:27.159
officials are sad that Ukraine

00:15:28.127 --> 00:15:30.963
cannot receive Petros

00:15:31.263 --> 00:15:32.264
because, as you

00:15:32.264 --> 00:15:35.935
said, it might be unnecessary escalation.

00:15:36.268 --> 00:15:38.671
And now it is happening right now.

00:15:38.671 --> 00:15:40.773
Today it is happening.

00:15:41.173 --> 00:15:42.775
And now Ukraine desperately

00:15:42.775 --> 00:15:44.543
needs more capabilities,

00:15:44.543 --> 00:15:46.679
including long range missiles,

00:15:47.079 --> 00:15:48.280
attack arms,

00:15:48.280 --> 00:15:50.516
maybe I sound naive, but

00:15:50.516 --> 00:15:52.484
can we make a long story short

00:15:52.484 --> 00:15:53.852
and give Ukraine all

00:15:53.852 --> 00:15:56.221
capabilities it needs and

00:15:57.222 --> 00:15:57.790
liberate

00:15:57.790 --> 00:15:58.824
all territories

00:15:58.824 --> 00:16:00.893
arouses sooner than later?

00:16:00.893 --> 00:16:01.860
Thank you.

00:16:04.296 --> 00:16:06.565
His answer is yes.

00:16:13.772 --> 00:16:15.107
I agree

00:16:16.909 --> 00:16:19.378
Let me be straightforward with you.

00:16:19.378 --> 00:16:20.145
Look,

00:16:23.148 --> 00:16:24.717
the fact is that

00:16:24.717 --> 00:16:26.885
it is important to remember

00:16:26.885 --> 00:16:29.021
that before Russia invaded.

00:16:29.955 --> 00:16:32.424
We dedicated an enormous amount

00:16:32.424 --> 00:16:35.060
of security assistance to Ukraine.

00:16:35.060 --> 00:16:38.130
And and we've given Ukraine

00:16:38.130 --> 00:16:38.931
what they needed

00:16:38.931 --> 00:16:41.533
when they needed to defend themselves.

00:16:41.533 --> 00:16:45.237
And since the invasion, that has resulted

00:16:45.237 --> 00:16:45.537
in more

00:16:45.537 --> 00:16:47.373
than $20 billion

00:16:47.373 --> 00:16:49.675
in terms of security assistance.

00:16:49.675 --> 00:16:50.943
Just today, I approved

00:16:50.943 --> 00:16:53.345
another $1.8 billion

00:16:53.345 --> 00:16:54.513
in additional assistance

00:16:54.513 --> 00:16:55.814
Ukraine

00:16:55.814 --> 00:16:58.317
for it to succeed on the battlefield.

00:16:58.317 --> 00:16:59.585
And we're focused on working

00:16:59.585 --> 00:17:00.853
with allies and partners

00:17:00.853 --> 00:17:04.123
to generate capability in four key areas

00:17:04.656 --> 00:17:05.824
air defense.

00:17:05.824 --> 00:17:07.326
As now as we know today,

00:17:07.326 --> 00:17:09.728
the Patriot is the best of that.

00:17:09.728 --> 00:17:12.698
Secondly, is to and we're looking to

00:17:12.698 --> 00:17:13.365
do more.

00:17:14.700 --> 00:17:15.501
We provided

00:17:15.501 --> 00:17:16.535
hundreds of advanced

00:17:16.535 --> 00:17:18.604
artillery systems and dozens

00:17:18.604 --> 00:17:21.373
from dozens of countries Thirdly,

00:17:21.373 --> 00:17:22.474
we work with partners

00:17:22.474 --> 00:17:23.776
to get Ukraine tanks

00:17:23.776 --> 00:17:25.778
and other armored vehicles.

00:17:25.778 --> 00:17:26.745
And fourthly,

00:17:26.745 --> 00:17:27.780
we've announced today

00:17:27.780 --> 00:17:29.882
another 200,000 rounds

00:17:29.882 --> 00:17:31.784
of additional ammunition.

00:17:31.784 --> 00:17:32.251
Do you say,

00:17:32.251 --> 00:17:34.019
why don't we just give Ukraine everything

00:17:34.019 --> 00:17:35.454
there is to give?

00:17:35.554 --> 00:17:36.989
Well, for two reasons.

00:17:36.989 --> 00:17:39.825
One, there's an entire alliance

00:17:40.192 --> 00:17:42.261
that is critical to stay with Ukraine.

00:17:42.995 --> 00:17:45.030
And the idea that we would give

00:17:45.464 --> 00:17:46.832
Ukraine material

00:17:46.832 --> 00:17:47.699
that is

00:17:47.699 --> 00:17:48.801
fundamentally different

00:17:48.801 --> 00:17:49.735
than is already going

00:17:49.735 --> 00:17:51.670
there would have a prospect

00:17:51.670 --> 00:17:52.337
of breaking up

00:17:52.337 --> 00:17:54.506
Naito and breaking up the European Union

00:17:54.506 --> 00:17:56.108
and the rest of the world.

00:17:56.108 --> 00:17:58.177
We're going to give Ukraine what it needs

00:17:58.510 --> 00:17:59.111
to be able

00:17:59.111 --> 00:18:00.512
to defend itself, to be able

00:18:00.512 --> 00:18:01.747
to succeed and succeed

00:18:01.747 --> 00:18:02.981
in the battlefield.

00:18:02.981 --> 00:18:05.284
And the other piece of this is,

00:18:05.284 --> 00:18:07.386
you may recall one of the reasons why

00:18:08.220 --> 00:18:09.721
I have spent

00:18:09.721 --> 00:18:11.190
well won't tell you the calculation,

00:18:11.190 --> 00:18:12.424
but I've spent

00:18:12.458 --> 00:18:15.227
several hundred hours face to face

00:18:15.828 --> 00:18:17.262
with our European allies

00:18:17.262 --> 00:18:19.498
and the heads of state of those countries

00:18:19.498 --> 00:18:21.667
and making the case as to why

00:18:21.667 --> 00:18:23.669
it was overwhelmingly in their interest

00:18:23.669 --> 00:18:25.704
that they continue to support Ukraine.

00:18:26.371 --> 00:18:28.240
They understand it fully,

00:18:28.240 --> 00:18:30.742
but they're not looking to go to war

00:18:30.742 --> 00:18:31.743
with Russia.

00:18:31.743 --> 00:18:32.377
They're not looking

00:18:32.377 --> 00:18:33.946
for a third world war.

00:18:33.946 --> 00:18:35.681
And I think it can all be avoided

00:18:35.681 --> 00:18:37.116
by making sure that Ukraine

00:18:37.116 --> 00:18:39.351
is able to succeed in the battlefield.

00:18:39.351 --> 00:18:42.020
So anyway, there's more to say,

00:18:42.020 --> 00:18:44.423
but I've probably already said too much.

00:18:44.423 --> 00:18:44.857
Thank you.

